tools.description:
Create or update a plan shown in the Dovetail dashboard at /claude-plans. Auto-slugs from title when slug is omitted. Status defaults to DRAFT.

Returns a feature_score {score:0..1, missing:[], hint} rating how fully this push uses the display surface (structured content, diagrams, linked PR, etc.). Act on a low score by attaching what's missing — push_diagram / push_artifact / content_structured — before presenting the plan.

Content — supply exactly one of:
  content_md: string — raw Markdown
  content_html: string — raw HTML (sanitized by DOMPurify)
  content_structured: object — zero-design component layout (preferred). Schema:
    { sections: [ ...section objects ] }

content_structured section types:
  { type:"header", title, subtitle? }
    Large title block, optional subtitle.
  { type:"meta", title?, rows:[{label,value,badge?}] }
    Key-value table. badge values: default|success|warning|danger|info
  { type:"callout", variant?, title?, message }
    Alert box. variant: info|warning|danger|success (default: info)
  { type:"checklist", title?, items:[{label,done,note?}] }
    Task list with checked/unchecked items.
  { type:"steps", title?, steps:[{label,status,note?}] }
    Pipeline stages. status: done|active|pending|error
  { type:"metrics", items:[{label,value,sub?,variant?}] }
    Stat cards. variant: default|success|warning|danger|info
  { type:"section", title }
    Labeled section divider.
  { type:"table", title?, headers:string[], rows:string[][] }
    Data table.
  { type:"text", content }
    Plain paragraph. Newlines become <br>.
  { type:"code", title?, lang?, content }
    Preformatted code block.

Example content_structured:
  { "sections": [
    { "type":"header", "title":"Deploy PR #42", "subtitle":"DEV → PROD" },
    { "type":"meta", "rows":[{"label":"Branch","value":"feature/auth"},{"label":"Status","value":"Approved","badge":"success"}] },
    { "type":"steps", "steps":[{"label":"DEV","status":"done"},{"label":"TEST","status":"active"},{"label":"PROD","status":"pending"}] },
    { "type":"checklist", "title":"Pre-deploy", "items":[{"label":"Tests pass","done":true},{"label":"Migration run","done":false}] }
  ] }
